spacenavd: spacenavd is a free software user-space daemon for 3Dconnexion 6DoF
spacenavd: input devices (SpaceMouse Compact, Pro, Enterprise, SpaceNavigator).
spacenavd: It acts as a drop-in replacement for the proprietary 3Dconnexion
spacenavd: 3dxsrv daemon, communicating with CAD software (FreeCAD, Blender,
spacenavd: KiCad, Maya) via UNIX domain sockets and X11 ClientMessages.
